      <span>{{ item }}</span>
    </li>
    {%- endfor %}
  </ul>
</section>

<!-- 03 — EXAMPLE -->
<section class="container measure section-block">
  <p class="label reveal" style="margin-bottom:1rem;">03 — What this looks like</p>
  <h2 class="display-md reveal reveal-delay-1" style="margin-bottom:1.25rem;">The same fact, three arguments</h2>
  <p class="body-lg reveal reveal-delay-2" style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;">The venting of a high-voltage battery is an inconspicuous component. With a pressure relief valve that opens only in a thermal incident, the battery stays closed and clean in normal operation.</p>
  <p class="body-lg reveal reveal-delay-2" style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;">For the vehicle manufacturer, that is an argument about warranty costs. For the end customer, a promise of durability. For the dealer, a sales argument against cheaper alternatives. The same technical fact — three different reasons to choose it.</p>
</section>

